Subject: [PATCH net-next 1/6] net: stmmac: rk: introduce flags indicating
 support for RGMII/RMII
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Disposition: inline
Message-Id: <E1vnYxl-00000007hol-3XiH@rmk-PC.armlinux.org.uk>
